This README file contains information on the contents of the meta-hockey layer.

Please see the corresponding sections below for details.

Dependencies
============

  URI: https://git.yoctoproject.org/meta-yocto
  branch: wrynose

The exact revisions used for development are pinned in hockey-pokey.conf.json
at the root of the yocto-hockey-poky repository.

Patches
=======

Please submit any patches against the meta-hockey layer as pull requests to
https://github.com/ruvi-d/yocto-hockey-poky

Maintainer: Ruvinda Dhambarage <contact@ruvi.tech>

Table of Contents
=================

  I. Adding the meta-hockey layer to your build
 II. Misc


I. Adding the meta-hockey layer to your build
=================================================

From an initialised build environment (see the top-level README.md), run:

  bitbake-layers add-layer /workspace/yocto-hockey-poky/meta-hockey

II. Misc
========

The layer currently contains no recipes. Recipes should be added under
recipes-*/<name>/ directories, which conf/layer.conf picks up automatically.

The layer is only compatible with the wrynose release series
(LAYERSERIES_COMPAT_meta-hockey = "wrynose").
